<title>FRANCE: Elf Atochem in China venture.</title>
<headline>Elf Atochem in China venture.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf Atochem, a unit of French energy group Elf Aquitaine, said on Thursday that it had signed a letter of intent with the Chinese company Changshu Jincheng Chemicals to build an organic peroxide plant in Changshu.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Elf Atochem would have a majority stake in the venture.</p>
<p>Construction of the plant is scheduled to begin the third quarter of 1997 with production set to get under way in late 1998. The plant is expected to have a 2,500 tonne annual production capacity.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452 cct</p>
